@startuml core-plot-shapes-component
title core-plot-shapes Component Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "core-plot" as CorePlot
component "core-plot-canvas" as Canvas
component "core-plot-shapes" as Shapes
component "core-plot-curve" as Curve
component "core-design-system /\ncore-style-system" as DesignSystem
component "lit" as Lit
component "core-math" as Math

interface "Canvas Contracts" as ICanvas
interface "SVG Shape API" as IShapes
interface "Curve Domain API" as ICurve
interface "Theme / Style Tokens" as ITheme
interface "Reactive Controller API" as ILit
interface "Geometry API" as IMath

Canvas - ICanvas
Shapes - IShapes
Curve - ICurve
DesignSystem - ITheme
Lit - ILit
Math - IMath

CorePlot ..> ICanvas
CorePlot ..> IShapes
CorePlot ..> ICurve
CorePlot ..> ITheme
CorePlot ..> ILit
CorePlot ..> IMath

Canvas ..> IShapes
Canvas ..> ITheme
Canvas ..> ILit
Canvas ..> IMath

Shapes ..> ITheme
Shapes ..> ILit
Shapes ..> IMath

note right of Shapes
  core-plot-shapes provides reusable
  SVG primitives and builders.
end note

note right of Canvas
  core-plot-canvas should depend on
  canvas contracts and shared styling,
  not plot-specific coordinates.
end note

@enduml
